<style>
    @import '../styles/homepage.css';
</style>

<section class="consultation-section">
    <div class="container consultation-container">
         <div class="section-header">
            <h2> What To Expect At Your Consultation </h2>
         </div>

         <div class="container-grid">
            <!-- STEP 1 -->
            <article class="consultation-card">
                <div class="card-content consultation-content">
                    <h3 class="consultation-title">Once you've booked</h3>
                    <div class="consultation-divider"></div>
                     <p class="">You'll receive a confirmation email. <br /><br /> During the next available working hours, Gya will personally give you a quick call to confirm the date and time of your appointment. <br /><br />There's no need to discuss treatments over the phone. <br />Everything important is explored together during your consultation.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- STEP 2 -->
            <article class="consultation-card">
                <div class="card-content consultation-content">
                    <h3 class="consultation-title">Arrive Feeling Comfortable</h3>
                    <div class="consultation-divider"></div>
                    <p>You'll receive a reminder 24 hours before your appointment, giving you plenty of time to plan your visit. <br /><br /> When you arrive, Gya will welcome you into a calm environment where you'll have time to settle in before your consultation begins.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- STEP 3 -->
            <article class="consultation-card">
                <div class="card-content consultation-content">
                    <h3 class="consultation-title">Get To Know You</h3>
                    <div class="consultation-divider"></div>
                    <p>Every consultation begins with a relaxed conversation. <br /><br /> To understand what you like about your appearance, the areas you'd like to improve, and the results you're hoping to achieve.<br />Gya will carefully assesses your skin structure, facial architecture and natural proportions..<br /><br />
                    As Gya explains her observations, you'll have a mirror so you can see exactly what she's seeing. Together, you'll explore different possibilities and understand why certain treatments may suit your face better than others.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- STEP 4 -->
            <article class="consultation-card">
                <div class="card-content consultation-content">
                    <h3 class="consultation-title">Your Personalised Plan</h3>
                    <div class="consultation-divider"></div>
                    <p>Gya will create a personalised plan based on your features and your goals. <br /><br />Some clients choose to begin with one treatment, while others prefer a gradual approach over time. <br /> Together, you'll decide what feels right for you.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

         </div>
    </div>
</section>


<style>
.consultation-section{
    padding-top: 6rem;
    padding-bottom:4rem;
}
.consultation-container{
    max-width: 1800px;
}
.consultation-header{
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
}
h2{
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: var(--font-extrabold);
    line-height: 1.1;
}
.consultation-subtitle{
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
}
.container-grid{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
.consultation-card {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
    border: 1px solid #eadfd8;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    border: 1px solid rgba(236, 72, 153, .08);
  }
 .card-content {
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }
.consultation-content {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.875rem;
  }
.consultation-title{
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: #b15cbd; 
}
.consultation-divider {
       height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(236, 72, 153, .2) 50%, transparent 100%);
    margin: .5rem 0;
}
</style>